{{:Header/Pets}}
In research you can use Vessels you gained from trekking to upgrade your main frame and vats, which help you get much more RP from tanks. Each Tank has their own bonuses, detailed information is down below. 

Pets can be placed in Capsule to level up passive pet bonuses. Each capsule has individual exp gain, meaning you can put the same species of pet in multiple Capsules and get exp from each of them. Each species' passive starts at level 0, and the first level needs 12 hours of exp. You can accelerate exp gain with help from tanks and pet passives.

If you want to reach lvl 400 in research, please read [https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1WscxHc--nSxZtsbLkyfmBSOzALcCQpZwW1bvly8U0mU/edit#gid=1396490651 Pushing IdleSkilling beyond its limits (by bart902)] (Note that it is outdated due to the Realm update)

